 Installs the signing key of the orbitop package repository and the apt
 source that uses it, so that new versions of orbitop arrive with the
 regular system update. It also pins the origin of the repository to
 priority 100 (apt_preferences(5)), so that its packages never replace
 packages of the distribution.

